      ]
    }
  ],
  "notes": "This entry covers the noun sense of {余|あま}り (remainder). The adverb あまり (not very; too much) is a separate usage.\n\nFORMS:\n{余|あま}る (to be left over) → {余|あま}り (the leftover part)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {割|わ}り{算|ざん}の{余|あま}り: remainder in division\n- {余|あま}りの{布|ぬの}: leftover fabric\n- {余|あま}りが{出|で}る: there is a surplus\n\nMATH USAGE:\nIn arithmetic, {余|あま}り indicates the remainder: 7÷2＝3{余|あま}り1.",
